   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Hi everybody! </span><div><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">I am struggling with ggplot. Here is what I want to do.</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">I want to produce a contour plot, but not with using filled.contour as shown below, but with ggplot (because it looks much better).</span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">I know that it is possible, but I cannot get it running. Here z has the dimensions of x*y and should be represented in terms of colours. </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">Does anybody have an example for that? I have also posted this in a R-forum, but without success. Thanks! </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">  </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">x&lt;-as.matrix(read.table(file=&quot;</span><a href=\"http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/x.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\" link=\"external\" style=\"color:rgb(85,26,139);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/x.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371035817000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3CQadgZsaASHw_z-qqvV8D\">http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/x.txt</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&quot;, dec = &quot;.&quot;)) </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">y&lt;-as.matrix(read.table(file=&quot;</span><a href=\"http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/y.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\" link=\"external\" style=\"color:rgb(85,26,139);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/y.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371035817000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3rtgy5YTT4OBNNCnVJixAK\">http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/y.txt</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&quot;, dec = &quot;.&quot;)) </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">z&lt;-as.matrix(read.table(file=&quot;</span><a href=\"http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/z.txt\" rel=\"nofollow\" link=\"external\" style=\"color:rgb(85,26,139);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/z.txt&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792371035817000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2ZMU9sT1VxjzxnGoyqf2OT\">http://www.color-space.de/webseiten/upload/dl/forum/z.txt</a><span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\">&quot;, dec = &quot;.&quot;)) </span><br style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-family:Verdana,Geneva,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><span style